=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

Let=E2=80=99s get you started with a ready-to-use template or a toolkit =
that works for you.

Whether you are looking to find a spark of inspiration or get a head start =
on your project, our templates library has 100s of custom-made templates =
designed for use cases across industries that will help you get started in =
minutes.=C2=A0

Where to find the templates
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D

**Starter templates** from the dashboard. Choose a template you prefer from=
 the dashboard when you open the app. Click on More Templates to browse for=
 more.

**Starter toolkits** from the dashboard. Start with a toolkit with example =
data that you can refer to find inspiration from. Customize the information=
 as needed.=C2=A0

**User-generated templates from the community.** Find inspiration from =
1000s of user generated templates available in the Creately community.=
=C2=A0

How to use Creately templates=C2=A0
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D

- Once you find the template you are looking for, add it to the workspace. =
You can add multiple templates to the same workspace as well and organize =
them however you like, side by side, on top of each other, etc.=20
=C2=A0


- Edit text on the template or change its color by clicking on it and add =
the information that you need to showcase.=20
=C2=A0


- Import other elements from your device to further customize your template=
, or use built-in Google image search to browse for more on the internet.

Ready to get started=3F
=C2=A0

